cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CrossTab Studio"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based application for tabulating and testing questionnaire data
  (e.g., Google Forms CSV exports). It runs R in the browser (webR), offers
  21 analyses including cross tabulation, chi-square tests, t tests, ANOVA,
  reliability analysis and text mining, and produces figures, a PDF report and
  an Excel workbook that reproduces the calculations with spreadsheet formulas.
  Data never leave the user's device.
authors:
